 - `respond_within_hours`: 72, 24, 8 or 1, depending on the urgency
 
+A body longer than 2000 characters is cut to its first and last thousand characters, so a request placed at the end of a long message still reaches the model; the prompt tells the model the request can be anywhere in the message. Only a request buried in the middle of a very long body is not seen.
+
 Anything the model answers outside these lists is replaced by `general` and `normal`. A ticket with neither subject nor body raises `ValueError`.
 
 Run the tests with `python -m unittest` from this directory.
